<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>kr.kjcstudio.thekjc-key-remind</string>
  <!-- thekjc.co.kr 앞문 서버 관리 열쇠 갱신 알림 — 달마다 1일 10:00 (2026-11-04 재권님 「1년단위로 갱신이 되도록」).
       `tools/thekjc-front/admin-key.py remind --send` 가 메일로 보낸 지 1년(값은 그 도구의 RENEW_DAYS)이 넘었거나
       보낸 기록이 없거나 · 보낸 뒤 갈고 다시 안 보냈으면 텔레그램 한 통. 아니면 아무것도 안 보낸다.
       **--send 와 KJC_ROLE=server 가 함께 있을 때만 보낸다** — 알림은 개발 서버(8765) 자리에서만 나간다.
       설치는 「켜기」(재권님 지시):
           cp launchd/kr.kjcstudio.thekjc-key-remind.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
           launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/kr.kjcstudio.thekjc-key-remind.plist -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/usr/bin/python3</string>
    <string>-u</string>
    <string>tools/thekjc-front/admin-key.py</string>
    <string>remind</string>
    <string>--send</string>
  </array>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>KJC_ROLE</key>
    <string>server</string>
  </dict>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/kjc/work/KJCStudio</string>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict><key>Day</key><integer>1</integer><key>Hour</key><integer>10</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>0</integer></dict>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/kjc/work/KJCStudio/logs/thekjc-key-remind.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/kjc/work/KJCStudio/logs/thekjc-key-remind.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
